🚢 Maritime Vessel Tracking System

A high-performance, enterprise-grade maritime tracking and analytics platform designed to deliver real-time vessel intelligence, predictive weather insights, and global maritime traffic analytics.

This system integrates AIS data processing, WebSocket streaming, and advanced analytics to provide a comprehensive maritime monitoring solution.
