🌟 Key Features
🔴 Real-time Vessel Streaming
Live vessel updates via WebSockets
Powered by Django Channels + Redis
Low-latency, high-throughput data streaming

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📡 AIS Data Stream Parser
Parses NMEA 0183 AIS messages
Extracts:
  Vessel position (lat/lon)
  Speed & course
  Vessel metadata
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌪 Storm Path Forecast Modeling
Predicts storm trajectories using numerical models
Calculates risk zones using the Cone of Uncertainty
Helps vessels avoid dangerous weather
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌍 Maritime Heatmap & Traffic Analytics
Aggregates large-scale vessel data
Generates:
Traffic density maps
Maritime congestion zones
Global shipping patterns
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

⚓ Port Analytics
Port congestion analysis
Arrival predictions
Operational insights
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🧭 Voyage Management
Route optimization
ETA calculation
Fuel consumption tracking
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🚨 Safety & Emergency Management
Storm tracking
Risk assessment tools
Real-time alerts & notifications
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🏗 Architecture
Frontend (React / Vue)
        │
        ▼
Django REST API Server
 ├── Authentication
 ├── Vessel Tracking
 ├── Voyages
 ├── Ports
 └── Safety & Weather
        │
 ┌──────┼──────────────┐
 ▼      ▼              ▼
Channels  Celery     External APIs
(WebSocket) Workers   (AIS, NOAA, MarineTraffic)
        │
        ▼
   Redis (Pub/Sub)
        │
        ▼
 PostgreSQL / SQLite

