📡 API Documentation
🔗 Core Endpoints
Endpoint	                             Method	            Description
/api/vessels/	                        GET/POST	           Manage vessels
/api/vessels/{id}/	               GET/PUT/DELETE	         Vessel details
/api/vessels/analytics_heatmap/       	GET	               Traffic heatmap
/api/voyages/	                        GET/POST	           Voyage management
/api/ports/	                          GET/POST	           Port management
/api/safety/storm_forecast/	            GET	               Storm predictions
/api/auth/register/                    	POST	             Register
/api/auth/login/	                      POST	             Login
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🧪 Example API Calls
# Heatmap
curl "http://localhost:8000/api/vessels/analytics_heatmap/?grid_size=0.5"

# Storm forecast
curl "http://localhost:8000/api/safety/storm_forecast/?lat=25&lon=-80"

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🔌 WebSocket Example
const ws = new WebSocket("ws://localhost:8000/ws/vessels/");

ws.onmessage = (event) => {
  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
  console.log("Vessel Update:", data);
};

